# Write-tier negative: an object literal whose lexical form is NOT NFC-normalized — the
# base "cafe" followed by U+0301 (combining acute accent), authored with an explicit Turtle
# \uXXXX escape so the non-canonical spelling survives editor/VCS normalization. gmn1_write
# hard-fails (lang:GmnNonCanonicalCodepoint) before any encoding, never a silent NFC fold.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

gmeow:noteX gmeow:statusLabel "cafe\u0301"^^xsd:string .
